      "extract": "arXiv:1002.4860v2 [math.GT] 3 Jun 2010 A STATE-SUM FORMULA FOR THE ALEXANDER POLYNOMIAL SAMSON BLACK Abstract. We develop a diagrammatic formalism for calculating the Alexander polynomial of the closure of a braid as a state-sum. Our main tools are the Markov trace formulas for the HOMFLY-PT polynomial and Young’s semi-normal repre- sentations of the Iwahori-Hecke algebras of type A.",
